name: ra_data_quality
dataset: ra_data_quality_dataset
measure: count
by[1]: CONTROL
comparator: gte
threshold: 1
severity: WARNING
description: "A control could not judge some records (ambiguous or missing tariff, a NULL balance field, a missing partner statement). Fix the data; the next run re-judges them. Runbook: config/runbooks/telco-ra-runbooks.md, Findings."
